**Stack:** Next.js 14 (App Router) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui + Recharts

**Design rules:**
- Dark theme (`bg-zinc-950`, `text-zinc-100`)
- Accent: `violet-500` interactive, `emerald-500` success, `amber-500` warning, `red-500` error
- Font: Inter
- Sidebar: fixed left, 220px, icon + label
